    <body>
      <p source="#source-24-53"><seg source="#source-24-53">おほくの予感に充ち</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-53-91"><seg source="#source-53-91">おまへの皮膚にはとどかず</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-91-117"><seg source="#source-91-117">はるかに高い所を</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-117-131"><seg source="#source-117-131">わたつた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-131-157"><seg source="#source-131-157">あの鋭い動きさへ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-157-183"><seg source="#source-157-183">速かに把へたのに</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-183-194"><seg source="#source-183-194">精神よ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-194-211"><seg source="#source-194-211">季節は錆だ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-211-228"><seg source="#source-211-228">新しい時へ</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-228-263"><seg source="#source-228-263">歩みを移すこともできず</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-263-277"><seg source="#source-263-277">灰は灰に</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-277-300"><seg source="#source-277-300">石は石に還つた</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-300-311"><seg source="#source-300-311">しかし</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-311-340"><seg source="#source-311-340">それらの冷やかさを</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-340-381"><seg source="#source-340-381">身をもつて感じてゐることは</seg></p>
      <p source="#source-381-405"><seg source="#source-381-405">もつと不幸だつた</seg></p>
    </body>
